.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-qw/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Leader `,L` opens the Logs tab[/bold #D7AFFF]                                [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]keymap[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]keymap: register the new `jump_to_last_error` leader action on `L` [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]across the keymap dataclass, default config, dispatcher, command [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]catalog, footer, help modal, and docs, with a first behavior that opens [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the Admin Center Logs tab.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Registered errors and error-anchored launch logs[/bold #D7AFFF]              [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]registry[dim] · [dim][/dim]after keymap[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]registry: stamp every launch-failure log entry with a stable error id, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]add the session-scoped registered-error pointer, make one helper both [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]register the error and emit its toast so the chord hint can never appear[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]without a target, and make `,L` select the registered error's log [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]source.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Logs pane focuses the registered error entry[/bold #D7AFFF]                  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]focus[dim] · [dim][/dim]after registry[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]focus: locate the registered error's anchor in a bounded tail scan, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]render a window containing it with the entry line highlighted, scroll [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the detail pane to it, and degrade with an in-pane notice when the entry[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]has aged out.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-qw","llm_provider":"claude","model":"sonnet","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-qw.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-0fd72150fadeae6850472396eccef10e","started_at":"2026-08-19T13:31:00.021916+00:00","state":"completed"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"68c6cb5690f9167937f61e025b43e08b796fb1df8e45532c339505d41b93b2cd","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-qw.2/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"a398c70160fe308637edd70b38d8cf02cc697183c480675d10f387d529663058","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-qw.2/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":80},"meta":{"digest":"f71808a91e9f418b50b7b69aeb45eb2faf717994a2c4adbce09d5e042570b172","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-qw.2/meta.json","size_bytes":633},"prompt":{"digest":"b0d96ba80c95e681e257912f61fc58b88b9bb27f558265eb0a383d1eeaa39a17","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-qw.2/prompt.md","size_bytes":141},"prompt_steps":{"digest":"45d05ee0888fb34660ed999afafe29dfc0d2ca822f0ab88881bc243037cb57ff","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-qw.2/prompt_steps.json","size_bytes":4173},"state":{"digest":"cade4f140c1c55f3d336d3399459ca8fef9c910ad14313d089a317a0af547f96","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-qw.2/state.json","size_bytes":180}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.sase-qw.2","local_name":"sase-qw.2","metadata":{"agent_clan":"sase-qw","agent_clan_generation":"20260819093036","approve":true,"bead_id":"sase-qw.2","changespec_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","cl_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-qw","llm_provider":"claude","model":"sonnet","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-qw.2","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-6387400193d8a2c5f5c4f4dcae8dbaa6","started_at":"2026-08-19T13:57:19.320567+00:00","state":"active"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"di